{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49767","headline":"定风波 · 孙光宪","name":"定风波","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘拂疎香断碧丝，泪衫还滴绣黄鹂。\n上国献书人不在，凝黛，晚庭又是落红时。\n春日自长心自促，翻覆，年来年去负前期。\n应是秦云兼楚雨，留住，向花枝夸说月中枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}